\x1b[1mDeviceChain - dcctl install - kind devicechain\x1b[m dcctl v1.12.0
------------------------------------------------------------
\x1b[1mHelp\x1b[m - Preflight

Enter       switch
Esc         keep
?/F1        help
Ctrl+C      exit

Switch changes the pending plan to the other footprint and
runs every check again for it; Keep leaves the plan as it
is. Nothing has been changed yet: nothing on these screens
changes anything until you approve the plan on the review.
Ctrl+C exits.




------------------------------------------------------------
Esc close help - Ctrl+C exit
